+// <prefix>_PATCHED_INTERPRET_ALL, a diagnosis: every unit of `part`
+// ("main", the executable, or "overlays", the patched overlays) runs under the
+// interpreter, as an emulator runs the patched disc; 1 for both.
+// <prefix>_PATCHED_INTERPRET_RANGE=lo-hi (hex) narrows the executable's part.
+// <prefix>_PATCHED_COMPARE_VBLANK=1 compares the code at every vblank too.
+[[nodiscard]] bool interpret_all_of(std::string_view part);
